    "body": "Related to #361 (vendor STEP tool models): the same gap holds for a tool's imported body - a spindle-frame mesh (#368) and a lathe holder with its placement and insert zone (#369, #396) are saved in a `.camproj` (`project/tool_body_wire.rs`) but not in a `.camtools` file, so a library of vendor-modelled tools loses every body on export. If this issue carries the body \"exactly like a .camproj tool\", it covers those too; worth a pin for one mesh body and one lathe body alongside the drawn-profile one.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
